WEBVTT

00:14:58.588 --> 00:15:01.180
na poslu ili u životu,

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.056
postoji reč za to što vidite.

00:15:03.056 --> 00:15:04.233
Oblak.

00:15:04.233 --> 00:15:05.766
I možete proći kroz taj oblak

00:15:05.766 --> 00:15:07.174
ne sami, već zajedno

00:15:07.174 --> 00:15:09.212
sa nekim ko vas podržava

00:15:09.212 --> 00:15:11.260
rekavši "Da, i" vašim idejama,

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.827
da vam pomogne da kažete
"Da, i" sopstvenim idejama

00:15:13.827 --> 00:15:15.464
i poveća šansu da

00:15:15.464 --> 00:15:17.190
kroz pramenove oblaka

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.688
nađete momenat mira

00:15:18.688 --> 00:15:20.491
u kome po prvi put nazrete

00:15:20.491 --> 00:15:23.741
vaše neočekivano otkriće,

00:15:23.741 --> 00:15:26.465
vaše C.

00:15:26.465 --> 00:15:28.785
Hvala vam.

00:15:28.785 --> 00:15:32.785
(Aplauz)